    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f87868a600eb16f3801efdc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "总而言之，我们当下要做的只有一件事。\n那就是携手跨越考验，收集那份闪耀的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75fb1f5b3f0602033c87d44a2c42bd0a1337012f0de06c54af17c1e666b1e640",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
