    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50ad78f821264fb0ddfc844e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我，无论前方是怎样的终点都将全力奔驰到底！\n还请您一如既往地支持这位一路向前的圣女。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ba297aa7a76b18c6c2b8e4056151aa2d8223948286bdce8d2ff3a3cf10b13dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
