      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在奔跑的尽头，我无从知晓她最终会抵达一个怎样的世界。\n我唯一能做的，就是去支持作为竞赛赛马娘的她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "632fe4ac3b4991c3c0b10d9e8afb443470704771946101c5a3e28da4165b2d76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
