      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "您，的确有资格成为圣女的伴侣。\n来吧，立下誓言的契约吧——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55bb84ba692e45e8b6735be5fbcaba8892968e6f2e8da6d8ec27927d53baad25",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
